c","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":2750262,"digest":"sha256:feb07389d04a6b31b66446d03314306ca8fa4f54d7ec5ade2444702c10b73f65","download_count":3,"created_at":"2026-09-26T10:28:30Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T10:28:31Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nhatquang1701/Koi-engine/releases/download/1.0.0/koi-engine-v1.0.0.zip"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nhatquang1701/Koi-engine/releases/assets/590447396","id":590447396,"node_id":"RA_kwDOUYBUo84jMYMk","name":"koi-engine-v1.0.0.zip.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"nhatquang1701","id":230510789,"node_id":"U_kgDODb1QxQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230510789?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhatquang1701","html_url":"https://github.com/nhatquang1701","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhatquang1701/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhatquang1701/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhatquang1701/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhatquang1701/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhatquang1701/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhatquang1701/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhatquang1701/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhatquang1701/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhatquang1701/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":89,"digest":"sha256:39fd96c06fd7f650360cd4e90f5ace46beea9ebeab02ba129a8c55ecb014c8a8","download_count":3,"created_at":"2026-09-26T10:28:30Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T10:28:30Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nhatquang1701/Koi-engine/releases/download/1.0.0/koi-engine-v1.0.0.zip.sha256"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nhatquang1701/Koi-engine/tarball/1.0.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nhatquang1701/Koi-engine/zipball/1.0.0","body":"# Koi Engine 1.0.0 pre-release\r\n\r\nThe first public release candidate of Koi Engine's classical CPU UCI engine for Windows x64 and Linux x86-64. The launcher selects the fastest supported bundled CPU variant and retains a baseline x86-64 fallback.\r\n\r\n## Downloads\r\n\r\n| Platform | Archive | SHA-256 |\r\n| --- | --- | --- |\r\n| Windows x64 | `koi-engine-v1.0.0.zip` | `FEB07389D04A6B31B66446D03314306CA8FA4F54D7EC5ADE2444702C10B73F65` |\r\n| Linux x86-64 | `koi-engine-v1.0.0-linux-x86_64.tar.gz` | `A2A766AF6E6F5A2E37AC270FFC2ADD2E7B20F6802DD8849B09E6E450CE25EA08` |\r\n\r\nVerify the matching `.sha256` file before extracting. Add `koi-engine.exe` on Windows or `koi-engine` on Linux to a UCI chess GUI. Each archive includes `INSTALL.txt`, the project and third-party licenses, and a `package.json` manifest with per-file hashes. The Linux archive targets Ubuntu 22.04 and newer glibc 2.35 systems.\r\n\r\n## Configuration\r\n\r\nStart with `Threads=1`, `Hash=512`, and `Speed=100`. The default `OwnBook=true` requires a user-supplied `book.bin`; no book or Syzygy files are included. Optional NNUE and GPU NNUE require separate assets or hardware. Koi 1.0.0 does not advertise `UCI_LimitStrength` or `UCI_Elo` and makes no absolute Elo rating claim.\r\n"}